                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4dfd77c9-3aba-3147-9ed1-cac8c8adc49d",
                        "entry_id": "a2feaf53-e880-3003-84fd-96720ef8bd82",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anger or irritability."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f87d5d8c-aef0-4e45-b546-cc059fced5bc",
                                "sense_id": "4dfd77c9-3aba-3147-9ed1-cac8c8adc49d",
                                "text": "Threatned with frowning wrath and iealouſie,\nSurpriz’d with feare and hideous reuenge,\nI ſtand agaſt: but moſt aſtonied\nTo ſee his choller ſhut in ſecrete thoughtes,\nAnd wrapt in ſilence of his angry ſoule."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec90429e-cddd-4e98-915a-c04c98f4762e",
                                "sense_id": "4dfd77c9-3aba-3147-9ed1-cac8c8adc49d",
                                "text": "This roused the tinker's choler, already provoked at Tugwell's amorous freedom with his doxy, and he gave him a click in the mazard. Tugwell had not been used tamely to receive a kick or a cuff; he, therefore, gave the tinker a rejoinder, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a1f3c79-e263-388a-8087-e7bd16fdb3e9",
